OL,4,CBird flu confirmed at commercial       
OL,5,Cpoultry farm                           
OL,6,GAn exclusion zone has been introduced  
OL,7,Gat a commercial poultry farm in        
OL,8,GHerefordshire after a case of bird flu 
OL,9,Gwas confirmed.                         
OL,11,FIt comes after the highly pathogenic   
OL,12,Favian influenza (H5N1) was identified  
OL,13,Fat a site near Leominster, the         
OL,14,FDepartment for Environment, Food and   
OL,15,FRural Affairs (Defra).                 
OL,17,FA 3km (1.8 mile) protection zone and a 
OL,18,Fwider 10km (6.2 mile) surveillance     
OL,19,Fzone are in place around the site to   
OL,20,Fhelp prevent the disease spreading,    
OL,21,Fwith Defra confirming all affected     
OL,22,Fbirds would be humanely culled.   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
