OL,4,CHorse-death crash driver gets          
OL,5,Csuspended jail term                    
OL,6,GA 76-year-old motorist with sight      
OL,7,Gproblems who drove into a woman in a   
OL,8,Gcrash that killed her horse has        
OL,9,Greceived a suspended jail sentence.    
OL,11,FRider Sophia Bradley, was injured in   
OL,12,Fthe collision at Uffington, near       
OL,13,FShrewsbury in October 2024, while her  
OL,14,Fhorse Ava, wearing full high-          
OL,15,Fvisibility clothing, died.             
OL,17,FDriver John Pearson, who had admitted  
OL,18,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous    
OL,19,Fdriving, "had a significant known      
OL,20,Fvisual impairment" and was not wearing 
OL,21,Fthe glasses he needed for driving,     
OL,22,FWest Mercia Police said.          G2/4 
