OL,4,CRoyal Blood to perform at Ludlow Castle
OL,5,GRock-duo Royal Blood are the latest    
OL,6,Gact to be announced for a series of    
OL,7,Gconcerts at Ludlow Castle next summer. 
OL,9,FThey will appear on 24 July and will   
OL,10,Fjoin acts including McFly, Becky Hill, 
OL,11,FUB40 ft. Ali Campbell, Paul Heaton and 
OL,12,FCourtneeners, with more yet to be      
OL,13,Fannounced.                             
OL,15,FPromoters Futuresound Group described  
OL,16,FRoyal Blood as "one of the most        
OL,17,Fimportant rock bands of their          
OL,18,Fgeneration," who have played "sold-out 
OL,19,Fheadline shows and major festivals to  
OL,20,Faudiences across the globe".           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
